The new test FAILS when the guard it names is removed, and the failure
message is the guard's own semantics ("both Posted"). Load-bearing confirmed.
The real tree was never mutated; both scratch copies were rm -rf'd.

OBSERVATION (not a defect): master's pre-existing TestDetect_NegativeBothChecks
also fails under this same mutation (its two "Check #99658N" rows share a
